{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 60087, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 44487, "uid": 22757, "type": 4, "title": "西瓦wb-预攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1604447824, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1605854982, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 8, "status": 1, "summary": "活动简介本次火WB开启时间为11月19日-12月3日，boss为火攻击型，技能如下图获取链接：https://ginmy.net/dc_worldboss_trial_zhyva●石化，沉默，混乱，眩", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 5, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16345, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 60087, "content": "<div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">活动简介</p></div>本次火WB开启时间为11月19日-12月3日，boss为火攻击型，技能如下图</div><div><p>获取链接：https://ginmy.net/dc_worldboss_trial_zhyva</p></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604451606884_21892351.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604451606884_21892351.png\"></div>● 石化，沉默，混乱，眩晕，睡眠减益无效</div><div>● 减益持续时间减少20%</div><div>● 自身减益回避率增加30%</div><div>● 自身充能加速20%<br></div><div><p>● <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">推测</span>防御力：3000<br></p><p>● 弱点防御下降40%<br></p><p>● TS：攻击前排4个单位并给予自身12层攻击力叠加<br></p><p>● SS：攻击前排5个单位并给予强打[眩晕+减防]，同时给予自身15层攻击力<br></p><p>● DS：攻击所有前排单位<br></p><p><br></p><p>和九尾狐wb的难点类似，前排生存压力会比较大。</p><p><br></p><p></p><p></p><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">加成天子</p></div><p>当期对策</p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604452347628_20700223.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604452347628_20700223.png\"></div><p>TS：几率解除队友的气绝和强打效果，根据boss强打状况再考虑是否使用</p><p>SS：增加3位攻击力最高的水属性队友的攻击力，后排水属性攻击力最高的5个角色技能伤害增加</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">DS（重点）</span>：我方攻击力最高的5个水属性成员TS伤害增加50%，同时后排水属性攻击力最高的5个角色获得[攻击态势]，FT期间只有这五个获得了[攻击态势]的角色会进行攻击。</p><p><br></p><p>由于SS的全技能增伤buff和FT期间的[攻击态势]以及boss的前排眩晕，水老头和机械丽莎请务必放在后排吃这两个buff。</p><p><br></p><p></p><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">阵容推荐</p></div><p>一、刀的选择</p><p>鉴于WB位置比较吃紧，建议只上3个刀，甚至于只上2个刀</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618102822_68450562.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">水老头：水刀中唯一的TS四连，WB永远的神，第一优先级，需要1或2攻<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1597825422926_49347527.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"width: 88px;\">菩萨：水刀中唯一的SS四连，第二优先级，需要1或2攻</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617816832_88326024.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">机械丽莎：上述水老头和菩萨其中一个没有练度或者没有的情况下再上，TS三连，请务必不要放在3攻位，否则完全没有输出，推荐度低<br></p><p>以下是备选3攻刀</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189912157_73193167.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">莎乐美：SS三连，之前有群友问为啥上莎乐美不上伊芙，伊芙毒伤害确实要高一点，但是伊芙是SS二连</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617575911_87980893.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">水护士：SS三连，火raid唯一指定水刀，wb输出一般，作为1或2攻的价值低于机械丽莎</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617806496_25735218.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">海星：SS三连，在有毒刀的情况下比较好，不推荐作为1或2攻<br></p><p><br></p><p>二、辅助（不讨论初音）</p><p>必上辅助如下</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594190653004_74793800.png\" alt=\"自嘲的娜薇\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/F5/ChpCl14J1GmEF8z8AAAAANAoPjg116.png\" alt=\"神乐狼人\" style=\"width: 92px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zL9SEa45XAAAAAMR6pbY614.png\" alt=\"悲恸的忒提斯\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zLZaEcirOAAAAALboDm0729.png\" alt=\"菜鸟莫娜\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B0/ChpCl13zKz6EOgtKAAAAAEvuG8w788.png\" alt=\"血腥的巴托里\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/AC/ChpCl13yEtiEJnvYAAAAAPzwKb4933.png\" alt=\"烈日沙滩莫娜\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/A4/ChpCl13wo_6EA2viAAAAABdDuH4613.png\" alt=\"甜美的希特莉\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/A1/ChpCl13wWqaESd6vAAAAAAmxlvM876.png\" alt=\"情报员布朗尼\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/98/ChpCl13uDuGEKaWvAAAAAAnDQSI094.png\" alt=\"审美的万达斯\"><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13uATCEFBNjAAAAAMbt-6M451.png\" alt=\"化身的嫦娥\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/95/ChpCl13txquEPVRpAAAAAAbwPa8640.png\" alt=\"盲信的玛亚特\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/82/ChpCl13nYY2EY18zAAAAAJ3K4fU025.png\" alt=\"流浪者的潘迪恩\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594191611278_91042388.png\" alt=\"脸红心跳希特莉\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618873746_90246811.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/15/58/ChpCl15EzVqEKkI_AAAAAFqFT2o144.png\" alt=\"伪君子巴贝尔\" style=\"width: 94px;\">狗哥为队长<br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">双加速 对于这个队伍的提升有待测试</span></p><p>以上总共15个辅助，算上3个刀以及对策辅助，总计18个角色，剩余可再增加1名角色</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">卢茵：增加debuff持续力，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/B1/ChpCl13zNB-EI_0hAAAAACgdvmg602.png\" alt=\"女朋友凯萨琳\" style=\"width: 93px;\">凯瑟琳（联动卡）：魅惑，阻止boss给自己上buff，没有木糖猫或者低加木糖猫可以上，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1592977383457_18187099.png\" alt=\"蜕变妲比\">暗妲比：目的是降低敌人的减益（强打）命中率，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1599027467205_89055324.png\" alt=\"逃亡缇丝贝\" style=\"width: 88px;\">鲜花：第二加速，DS效果较好，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gBTCEfRv7AAAAAGdooMc218.jpg\" alt=\"浪漫的伊菲斯\" style=\"width: 85px;\">狗姐：木人鱼低加需要狗姐，如果在没有狗哥的情况下依旧可以保证队伍的生存，可以让狗姐作为队长代替狗哥，增加debuff命中率，技能预约T<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/E1/ChpCl17ODuKESuwdAAAAAFHew-s512.png\" alt=\"情热王欧洛拉王\">光史莱姆：全体增加防御，生存压力过大的时候可以上，技能预约S</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/16/66/ChpCl16gCnGEUGNvAAAAALStrxk044.png\" alt=\"纯白的波摩纳\">花奶：解除减益（血量最低的2名角色），可能解空气，可以针对强打，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/AC/ChpCl13yEVuEeB01AAAAAIltAII249.png\" alt=\"仲夏秋牡丹\">牡丹：加速比嫦娥（默认P）少，但是稳定给攻击力最高的加攻击力，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618927035_95711805.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\">独眼：增加SS伤害以及69.5%的加速，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/14/97/ChpCl13t-72ETMBRAAAAAEONAr8699.png\" alt=\"疾走的玛尔斯\">水炮：全体上盾，WB唯一指定盾，技能预约S<br></p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1603093941847_17038781.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"width: 88px;\">雷芳：百分比减防，高加可以上，虽然和木伞的buff冲突但是可以延长减防时间，技能预约S<br></p><p></p><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">装备和攻击力调配</p></div><p>不知道敏捷对debuff命中率是否有影响，不进行考虑。</p><p>在不考虑新魂卡特性的情况下，魂卡需要注意</p><p>TS刀带增加攻击和暴击的魂卡，越高越好</p><p>SS刀请带如下魂卡（增加水属性角色的SS伤害）</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/14/CB/ChpCl13550qEI4_zAAAAAK7aDdA490.png\" alt=\"午休时刻\"><br></p><p><br></p><p>毒刀请带如下魂卡（水属性，增加世界王的中毒伤害）</p><p><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1597821003767_28978681.png\" alt=\"夏日餐宴\"><br></p><p>关于攻击力计算</p><p>1攻和2攻角色需要比3攻以及其他角色高一定的攻击力，因为糖猫的buff是随机的，要根据自己的糖猫加值来定，用P糖猫举例</p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604455426703_96651701.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1604455426703_96651701.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">P糖猫会增加2208攻击力，那么1攻和2攻角色需要比3攻以及其他角色高至少2208攻击力才能保证其他角色不会抢buff</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">队长技能</p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">如果没生存压力，上狗哥的同时队长技能给狗哥，如果没有生存压力，可以把队长给狗姐</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">DS顺序</p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">我个人使用的是木人鱼和光月月双循环也可以将火莫娜加入循环</div><div class=\"div-img\">以下部分同霞WB的内容</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif;\">经过</span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">初月炭</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif;\">在日服的测试，wb中2回合的持续时间可能长到超乎想象。为了方便辨识buff的图标，具体测试对象为木莫娜的ds（木刀优先三体充能量提升，赋予应援，3回合），过程中木莫娜全程ts，其应援buff的图标持续时间从剩余时间4:25到剩余时间0:40，约为三分半，因此2回合时间也不会太短，具体可以等国际服测试。那么现在看向鲜花妹的ds，优先最高攻的三体充能量提升60%（与嫦娥加速种类相同），2回合，</span><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">注意是三体，2回合</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, arial, &quot;hiragino sans gb&quot;, stheiti, &quot;microsoft yahei&quot;, sans-serif;\">，嫦娥只有两体，这次主刀又是ts刀，嫦娥的-2s等于没有，可以作为一种思路来替换嫦娥，因为鲜花妹本身的技能机制比起嫦娥要优秀得多，在加速上远超嫦娥。</span><br></div><p><br></p><p>WB开启之后会更新实战</p></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 22757, "username": "聚义灬efg", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/24.png", "description": "咸鱼一个", "follow_num": 7, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "退休老年人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 126616236, "content_num": 12, "read_num": 226578, "like_num": 87}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676